# `apps/` — predecessors, not the product

`index.html` at the repo root is the main file (owner's direction, 2026-08-14).
Everything here is kept for reference.

**Read from these freely. Do not edit them unless the owner names the file.**

See [`apps/CONVERGENCE.md`](../../apps/CONVERGENCE.md) for the merge plan and the dated
decisions behind it.

## `apps/review/index.html` — superseded 2026-08-14

Still the only home of the **live GL engine**: `glLedger()`, the 152-account REIT chart
that foots via cash-plug and retained earnings, every taxonomy derived from `E_ACC`. It is
also the deepest flux surface in the repo. **Porting that engine into the main file is the
open increment.** Guide: [`apps/review/CLAUDE.md`](../../apps/review/CLAUDE.md).

Two things to know before lifting anything out of it:

- its type scale is **rem**, the main file's is **px** — convert, never paste;
- it keeps its aliases and dark ramp both on `:root`, while the main file splits them
  across `html` / `body`.

Its `--k-*` gold/teal/navy tokens and the "no blue accents" / "teal for positive" rulings
are **withdrawn** for the main file — see the design-system rule.

## `apps/dashboard/korvyn_dashboard.html`

The ancestor `index.html` grew out of — same spine ribbon, same `RECON_SCALE`, same baked
`EGL_DATA` snapshot. Much of the *reasoning* in
[`apps/dashboard/CLAUDE.md`](../../apps/dashboard/CLAUDE.md) still transfers, but where it
quotes a token name, line number or screen detail, **verify against `index.html` first** —
the descendant has moved on.

`packages/core/tools/emit_enterprise_gl.mjs` and `tools/check_chrome_themes.mjs` were both
re-pointed at `index.html` on 2026-08-14 and no longer read this file.

`apps/review/mocks/` are design explorations. Reference only.
